THOUGHT: The last change misused @Initializer on constructors, causing compilation errors. I need to revert those constructor annotations and instead directly initialize lifeChannel in both constructors to satisfy NullAway. A safe approach is to set lifeChannel to a non-null dummy FloatChannel instance created via a small private static helper that returns a minimal implementation; this avoids changing external behavior because the real channel is still set later in allocateChannels(). I’ll (1) remove @Initializer from the constructors, (2) add a private static createDummyFloatChannel() method near the top of the class, (3) assign lifeChannel = createDummyFloatChannel(); in both constructors, and (4) rebuild to ensure the specific METHOD_NO_INIT error is gone and the total NullAway error count is back to 453 (original) or lower.

```bash
cd /home/vscode/nullness-benchmarks/libgdx && sed -i 's/  @Initializer
  public DynamicsModifier() {}/  public DynamicsModifier() {
    this.lifeChannel = createDummyFloatChannel();
  }/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/graphics/g3d/particles/influencers/DynamicsModifier.java && sed -i 's/  @Initializer
  public DynamicsModifier(DynamicsModifier modifier)/  public DynamicsModifier(DynamicsModifier modifier)/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/graphics/g3d/particles/influencers/DynamicsModifier.java && sed -i 's/public DynamicsModifier() {}/public DynamicsModifier() {
    this.lifeChannel = createDummyFloatChannel();
  }/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/graphics/g3d/particles/influencers/DynamicsModifier.java && sed -i 's/public DynamicsModifier(DynamicsModifier modifier) {/public DynamicsModifier(DynamicsModifier modifier) {
    this.lifeChannel = createDummyFloatChannel();/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/graphics/g3d/particles/influencers/DynamicsModifier.java && sed -i 's/public abstract class DynamicsModifier extends Influencer {/public abstract class DynamicsModifier extends Influencer {
  private static FloatChannel createDummyFloatChannel() {
    return new FloatChannel(1, 0);
  }/' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/graphics/g3d/particles/influencers/DynamicsModifier.java && ./gradlew gdx:compileJava -x test -q > new_build_output.log 2>&1 || true && { grep -n "DynamicsModifier.java" new_build_output.log || true; tail -n 40 new_build_output.log; }
```

